OL,3,AAustralian teen missing in bush for six
OL,4,Adays rescued alive
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager missing for six days in
OL,7,Fdense Australian bushland has been
OL,8,Ffound alive.
OL,10,FWilliam, whose surname has not been
OL,11,Freleased, disappeared last Friday while
OL,12,Fon a camping trip with a friend in
OL,13,Fbushland about 180km (112 miles) east
OL,14,Fof Melbourne, Victoria.
OL,16,FExtremely cold overnight temperatures
OL,17,Fhad left authorities concerned for the
OL,18,F17-year-old's welfare. Police dogs,
OL,19,Fdivers and helicopters had been
OL,20,Finvolved in the search.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
