OL,3,AAustralian teen missing in bush for six
OL,4,Adays rescued alive
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was located on Friday morning and
OL,7,Freunited with his relieved family, who
OL,8,Fsaid he was uninjured but "grounded for
OL,9,Flife".
